## 2. Architecture & Resilience Mechanics

```
                       Virtual IP (VIP): {{ cka_lab_ha_cluster_vip }}:{{ cka_lab_ha_cluster_port }}
                                       │
                ┌──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┐
                ▼                      ▼                      ▼
        ┌────────────────┐     ┌────────────────┐     ┌────────────────┐
        │ kube-cp-1      │     │ kube-cp-2      │     │ kube-cp-3      │
        │ 192.168.56.10  │     │ 192.168.56.11  │     │ 192.168.56.12  │
        ├────────────────┤     ├────────────────┤     ├────────────────┤
        │ Keepalived     │     │ Keepalived     │     │ Keepalived     │
        │ [VRRP MASTER]  │◄───►│ [VRRP BACKUP]  │◄───►│ [VRRP BACKUP]  │
        │ Priority: 103  │     │ Priority: 102  │     │ Priority: 101  │
        ├────────────────┤     ├────────────────┤     ├────────────────┤
        │ HAProxy :{{ cka_lab_ha_cluster_port }} │     │ HAProxy :{{ cka_lab_ha_cluster_port }} │     │ HAProxy :{{ cka_lab_ha_cluster_port }} │
        │ Health Check   │     │ Health Check   │     │ Health Check   │
        └───────┬────────┘     └───────┬────────┘     └───────┬────────┘
                │                      │                      │
                └──────────────┬───────┴──────────────┬───────┘
                               │ Active TCP Health Checks (SSL /livez)
                               ▼
        ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
        │                   kube-apiserver Pool                        │
        │  • CP1: 192.168.56.10:6443                                    │
        │  • CP2: 192.168.56.11:6443                                    │
        │  • CP3: 192.168.56.12:6443                                    │
        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

1. **Layer 1 (HAProxy)**: Co-located on all control planes listening on port `{{ cka_lab_ha_cluster_port }}`.
   Health-checks all three local and remote `kube-apiserver` endpoints on `6443`.
2. **Layer 2 (Keepalived VRRP)**: Manages floating VIP `{{ cka_lab_ha_cluster_vip }}`. If the active master dies or
   HAProxy stops responding, the VIP automatically migrates to the next healthy CP node in ~2 seconds.

